#Протокол_Unified_Linkage_Projection_V1<[
Базис:
  Старый ioHasC хранит unified linkage как derived JSON (`.iohasc/unified-linkage.v1.json`); rebuild уже имеет Trace Links v1 parser/validator в src/workGraphRuntime.mjs.
  Canonical source остаётся `.bvc` atoms и Work Graph snapshot; linkage JSON — read model для architecture map, verification и PVRG scope.
Вектор:
  unified-linkage.projection.v1 собирается из:
  - parseTraceLinksV1(items) — forward links from trace.* labels
  - scanReverseTraceMarkers(fileContentsByPath) — reverse code markers
  - work.target_files и depends_on как weak planning edges (confidence low, relation targets/depends_on)
  Output path convention: work/unified-linkage.v1.json (rebuild) или `.iohasc/unified-linkage.v1.json` при port в sibling repo.
  Consumers: architectureSnapshot L2, verification loop trace tier, pvrgTaskScope seed expansion, backlog UI derived graph.
Цель:
  Step-code relations доступны как stable derived artifact без второго authoring surface.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: unified-linkage-projection-v1
  work.source: port-unified-linkage-serialization
